    "learningOutcomes": "1. In-Depth Exploration: Throughout the course, we will meticulously examine the commentary, delving into its key concepts and principles. In addition to this foundational analysis, we will provide supplementary insights and contextual information regarding Arabic syntax, enhancing students' comprehension of the intricacies of the language.\n2. Target Audience: Designed specifically for students who have successfully completed one year of Arabic studies, this course aims to elevate their understanding of Arabic syntax to new heights. Participants will find themselves well-equipped to engage with more advanced linguistic concepts and discussions.\n3. Teaching Methodology: Conducted in English, the course ensures that students can grasp complex ideas without the additional challenge of language barriers. This approach allows for a focused exploration of the material while fostering a supportive learning environment.",
