        "overview": "This lesson continues to explore how scholars have defined ʿadālah, the intellectual origins of these definitions, and the critiques raised against them. It situates the discussion within broader debates in uṣūl al-fiqh and ʿulūm al-ḥadīth, highlighting the need for objectivity, balance, and scholarly restraint.",
        "topic": ""
