        "overview": "In our second lesson, we continue with our introduction, revisiting some of the points made in the previous lesson, and thereafter explaining the usage of Sunniyyah and Istiḥbāb.\nThe differing views in the School explaining Sunniyyah and Isithbaab are covered, referencing Marghinani, Babarti, Ibn al-Humam, and al-Lakhnawi. The concept of Muwazabah and its effect on Sunniyyah was discussed in detail.\n\nFinally, the differentiation between rulings that are Ta'abbudiyyah and those that are Ma'qul al-Ma'na were visited, along with the role of the Faqeeh in approaching them.",
