        "overview": "In this lesson we cover the methodology of al-Imam al-Quduri, explaining 6 key factors the student will find within the Mukhtasar. After this, we cover the legacy of the Mukhtasar and the many books that stem from it, showing how crucial it is to the Hanafi School of Thought.",
