        "title": "Lesson 5: How to study the Mukhtasar",
        "overview": "In this lesson, we explain to students how to study the Mukhtasar. When a student first begins reading Hawashi and Shurooh, he finds that there far too much information to retain, so he is required to summarize. Unfortunately, without knowing what is crucial to his level and what should be left for later levels, the summary is not as effective as it could be. For this reason, we've compiled worksheets designed to guide and help the students in taking notes. In this video, we show a practical example of how we would expect students to use the worksheets.",
