        "overview": "In this lesson, we begin the discussion of الصَّحِيحُ (al-Ṣaḥīḥ) by presenting the definition given by the author and comparing it with the definition of Ibn al-Ṣalāḥ. We then examine the precise wording of Ibn al-Ṣalāḥ’s definition and explore its implications in detail and misconceptions regarding it. The lesson concludes by introducing the definition of al-Khaṭṭābī, whose discussion will be continued in the following session.",
