        "overview": "This lesson discusses the authorship, methodology, and pedagogical challenges of Uṣūl al-Shāshī. It aims to clarify key ideas and correct inaccuracies.\n\n🔗 Enroll in the full course:\nhttps://talweehacademy.com/courses/a-critical-study-of-usul-al-sashi/\n\nCheck out our first level in Ḥanafī Uṣūl:\nhttps://talweehacademy.com/courses/hanafi-usul-al-fiqh-level-01/\n\nFor all our courses in different disciplines visit:\nhttps://talweehacademy.com/course/\n\n#usulalshashi #usulalfiqh #islamicstudies #hanafi #fiqh #sacredknowledge #islamicscholarship #talweehacademy #knowledge #seekknowledge #ilm #shariah #islamiceducation",
        "topic": ""
